summary:
  The history takes every title without asking the rules, slogans and the
  station's own name included.

history:
  Before the rules moved into TrackLogic the history compared a new title
  with the newest row and nothing else. Dance Wave! takes turns between two
  slogans, so on 2026-09-23 all thirty rows were slogans seven minutes in.
  main.qml cannot be unit-tested; the invariant pins that it asks.

target:
  package/contents/ui/main.qml

find:
          if (!TrackLogic.historyTakes(historyModel, artist, trackName, station)) return;

replace:
          if (!trackName) return;

expect:
  Killed by tests/test_invariants.py::test_the_history_asks_the_tested_rules_before_it_takes_a_row.
  Line-neutral.
